rarity: ['Rare']
text: ["Exile a creature you control: Add X mana of any one color, where X is 1 plus the exiled creature's mana value. Spend this mana only to cast creature spells.", "Other Merfolk get +1/+1 and have islandwalk. (They can't be blocked as long as defending player controls an Island.)", 'Search your library for a blue instant card, reveal that card, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', 'Search your library for a card, then shuffle and put that card on top. You lose 2 life.', "Until your next turn, your life total can't change and you gain protection from everything. All permanents you control phase out. (While they're phased out, they're treated as though they don't exist. They phase in before you untap during your untap step.)\\nExile Teferi's Protection.", 'Whenever an opponent casts a spell, you may draw a card unless that player pays {1}.', "{T}: Add one mana of any color in your commander's color identity.\\nSacrifice Commander's Sphere: Draw a card.", "{X}{U}{R}, {T}: Nin, the Pain Artist deals X damage to target creature. That creature's controller draws X cards."]
flavor: ['"I can tell you what you wish to know. But first, there is the matter of my fee."', '"Someday, when the world is safe again, my homeland will return."\\n—Teferi', '"Your body is a delicate instrument that tells me truths. These devices help me \'tune\' that instrument."', 'A master of tactics, the Lord of Atlantis makes his people bold in battle merely by arriving to lead them.', 'A rare find, suitable for the most discerning collector.', "Every predator is something else's prey.", 'Friends teach what you want to know. Enemies teach what you *need* to know.', 'It harmonizes with the essence of its master.']
artist: ['Brad Rigney', 'Chase Stone', 'Craig J Spearing', 'Gabor Szikszai', 'Lucas Graciano', 'Paul Scott Canavan', 'Ryan Alexander Lee', 'Scott Murphy']
